# Smaug's Fury: "Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains reach and first strike until end of turn" (CR 611.2a). Bot1 casts it on
# its own Goblin Assailant (2/2 becomes 5/2 with reach and first strike, toughness untouched) and the effect ends with the
# turn, so the 2/2 is plain again on the opponent's turn; on turn 3 it targets the opponent's Ornithopter (0/2 flyer),
# showing any creature is a legal target. The Assailant, not targeted the second time, stays 2/2.

